    "title": "Seven Ventura Retailers Pass Alcohol Compliance Test - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ventura Breeze ,\n7 hours ago Seven alcohol retailers in Ventura recently demonstrated full compliance with state law during a recent Minor Decoy Operation conducted by the Ventura Police Department on Saturday, January 17, with no sales made to an underage decoy. The operation reflects continued efforts to prevent underage access to alcohol and support responsible business practices citywide. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
